# Build-time settings for the hosted build. Nothing secret lives here: the hosted app has no secrets,
# because every visitor brings their own key. Vite only exposes VITE_-prefixed values.

# Linked from the app's "Open source" line. If you fork this, point it at your fork.
VITE_REPO_URL=https://github.com/srijanshukla18/tree-learn
